      "id": "69f58bb84bc6f097b4f5cf1a",
      "text": "2026年の昭和の日",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699769
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf7599",
      "text": "from [2026/04/29]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699769
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf759a",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699914
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf759b",
      "text": "[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699769
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf759c",
      "text": "\t[昭和の日]、何で昭和なんだと思ったらお誕生日か",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699769
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf759d",
      "text": "\tそういえば去年が[昭和100年]だったっけ、と思い出す",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1786352460
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bb90000000000cf759e",
      "text": "\t\t100年、という時間が長いのか短いのか、対象次第なのは当然として考える",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699769,
      "updated": 1777699769
    },
    {
      "id": "6a79937800000000002a0bcb",
      "text": "\t\t[100年以上続く企業]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786352504,
      "updated": 1786352531
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bff00000000007700f9",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1777699840,
      "updated": 1786352854
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bff00000000007700fb",
      "text": "[hoagecko.icon]",
      "userId": "6436266c7ac3c0001bed60e6",
      "created": 1777699840,
      "updated": 1777699840
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58bff00000000007700fc",
      "text": " 財務省が発表した[昭和100年記念貨幣]のデザインが酷い",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1777699840,
      "updated": 1786352942
    },
    {
      "id": "69f58c39000000000023f144",
      "text": "",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1777699898,
      "updated": 1786353182
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5d4",
      "text": "from [2026/04/30]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449741
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5d6",
      "text": "昨日、[昭和100年]は去年だと話してたけど、昭和元年から数えて100年の式典が昨日行われていたことを知り微妙に混乱[Hiro Aki.icon]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449750
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5d7",
      "text": "\t[https://www.cas.go.jp/jp/seisaku/showa100nen/portal/index.html 「昭和100年」ポータルサイト]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449741
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5d8",
      "text": " [昭和100年記念式典 高市首相“果敢に挑戦し希望を生み出す” | NHKニュース https://news.web.nhk/newsweb/na/na-k10015110971000]",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449741
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5d9",
      "text": " 今年は昭和101年、昭和元年から数えて今年が100年目、そのため１年のズレだと理解出来るけど慣れぬ",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449741
    },
    {
      "id": "6a7b0f4d00000000000bb5da",
      "text": " [数え年]な扱いを経験していないからだろう",
      "userId": "5c30ba88e98efe0017e5172d",
      "created": 1786449741,
      "updated": 1786449741
    },
